### Test Authentication Flow

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5049/api/v1
@email = test@example.com
@password = SecurePass123!

### 1. Register a new volunteer
POST {{baseUrl}}/volunteers/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "phone": "+1234567890",
  "dateOfBirth": "1995-05-15",
  "addressStreet": "123 Main St",
  "addressCity": "Montreal",
  "addressStateProvince": "QC",
  "addressPostalCode": "H1A 1A1",
  "addressCountry": "Canada",
  "emergencyContactName": "Jane Doe",
  "emergencyContactPhone": "+0987654321",
  "areasOfInterest": ["First Aid", "Community Outreach"],
  "availability": {
    "daysOfWeek": ["Monday", "Wednesday"],
    "timePreference": "Evenings"
  },
  "languagePreference": "en"
}

### 2. Login with credentials
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 3. Get My Onboarding Progress (with token from login)
# @name loginResponse
GET {{baseUrl}}/onboarding/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginResponse.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. Submit a step (with token from login)
POST {{baseUrl}}/onboarding/me/steps/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{loginResponse.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stepId": "STEP_ID_HERE"
}

### 5. Test unauthorized access (no token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/onboarding/me
